  "title": "Ranjit Singh",
  "summary": "Ranjit Singh (1780–1839) led the Sukhcheriya misl, a Sikh confederacy, from Gujranwala. He took Lahore by force in 1799 and two years later was anointed maharaja of the Sikhs. His rule is described as bringing a period of peace to the region; his empire collapsed within about ten years of his death.",
